        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "You have 8 hours to prevent Elvin, a psychotic genius from destroying the world in this sequel to the highly successful Impossible Mission. Enter Elvin's tower fortress, avoid his robots, assemble security combinations for each tower, recover musical sequences and tie them together into a full melody to reach Elvin's central control room.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Tienes 8 horas para impedir que Elvin, un genio psicótico, destruya el mundo en esta secuela del muy exitoso Impossible Mission. Entra en la fortaleza-torre de Elvin, evita sus robots, arma las combinaciones de seguridad de cada torre, recupera las secuencias musicales y únelas en una melodía completa para llegar a la sala de control central de Elvin.",
          "source": "claude",
